# codes: R1002 R1002
file "dup_formal.sp" deck
  title "dup_formal"
  comment " oracle: settle dup_formal.sp (a body .param naming the formal replaces its default; an instance's value still wins): exact as the default when the value reads no name (cell: the card Inert, R1002); dup_formal_reads.sp (twin's value reads a body parameter): Unread R1002"
  subckt cell (1 2) w=3
    opaque ngspice inert ".param w=3"
    element resistor r1 (1 2) value=w
  subckt twin (1 2) w=1
    param k = 2
    opaque ngspice unread ".param w={k*2}"
    element resistor r1 (1 2) value=w
